                <Text>
                    <LocaText>
                        <English>
                            <Text>&lt;b&gt;Amira has vanished from her family's house,&lt;/b&gt; and the whole clan is searching the dunes for her. In all the commotion, nobody has thought to sit with her father and sisters. Hamza asks you to visit them — perhaps they know more than they realise.</Text>
