            <Values>
                <Standard>
                    <GUID>1404001578</GUID>
                    <Name>RQ_Nomad_Select_FindFamily_LetterContent</Name>
                </Standard>
                <Text>
                    <LocaText>
                        <English>
                            <Text>&lt;i&gt;(a letter from Amira, found under her sister Nadia's pillow)...&lt;/i&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;Dearest Nadia, do not tell Father yet. Since Mother died, he has worked himself to the bone to pay the tax farmer, and he says a girl's place is at home. But &lt;b&gt;I have cut my hair and joined Hassan's caravan as a camel boy.&lt;/b&gt; The caravan pays well, and nobody looks closely at a boy with a dusty face.&lt;br/&gt;We camp at the harbour tonight before crossing the dunes. I will send money with the first merchant who returns. Pray for me...</Text>
                            <Status>Exported</Status>
                        </English>
                    </LocaText>
                    <LineID>43741</LineID>
                </Text>
            </Values>
        </Asset>
